# smoke.list — the curated ADRT_SESSION_SMOKE=1 live scenario set.
#
# Runs against the REAL GNOME Shell, so it is deliberately small: the features a
# change is most likely to break, and the ones whose behaviour only the live
# session proves (real clients, real z-order, real pointer). Every scenario still
# opens and closes only its own windows and restores the workspace it started on.
# The full live suite (`scripts/session-test.sh`, all S*.sh) stays the gate.
#
# Format: one scenario id per line, with or without a trailing `.sh`; blank lines
# and `#` comments are ignored. An entry whose file does not exist is a hard
# failure of the run, named on stderr — the list can never silently drop one.
#
# Feature -> scenario map (see tests/MANUAL.md and docs/V2_MODEL.md):
#
#   extension health / journal clean       S01-extension-health
#   pair tiling + third-window routing     S02-pair-and-third
#   resize + undo + swap                   S03-resize-undo-swap
#   maximize / unmaximize model            S04-maximize-model
#   minimize / close / workspace reap      S05-minimize-close-reap
#   float + lone-window maximize           S06-float-and-lone
#   border suppression on a switch         S07-border-switch
#   app-open maximize routing              S10-app-maximized
#   above-floats / z-order                 S19-above-floats
#   focus cycle                            S20-focus-cycle
#   highlight hidden on fullscreen         S21-fullscreen-no-highlight
#   cursor to the active window centre     S22-cursor-centre
#   windows stay inside the screen         S24-clamp-to-screen
#
# Not in the smoke (kept in the full live suite, or skipped here):
#   S08 keybindings (needs ydotool), S09 periodic retile (backstop, nested A66),
#   S13 overview workspace move (nested A74/A56), S15/S17 need hardware (two
#   monitors / docking), S18 is a recorded test gap, S11/S12/S14 are retired.

# --- health ---
S01-extension-health
# --- tiling / routing ---
S02-pair-and-third
# --- resize / undo / swap (fixed live) ---
S03-resize-undo-swap
# --- maximize / unmaximize ---
S04-maximize-model
# --- minimize / reap (fixed live) ---
S05-minimize-close-reap
# --- float / lone maximize ---
S06-float-and-lone
# --- border suppression (fixed live) ---
S07-border-switch
# --- app-open maximize (fixed live) ---
S10-app-maximized
# --- z-order / above floats ---
S19-above-floats
# --- focus cycle ---
S20-focus-cycle
# --- highlight on a fullscreen window ---
S21-fullscreen-no-highlight
# --- cursor to the active window ---
S22-cursor-centre
# --- windows stay inside their monitor ---
S24-clamp-to-screen
